# This file contains fish universal variable definitions.
# VERSION: 3.0
#
# laughdots note: only fisher's own bookkeeping lives here. The
# fish_color_* / fish_pager_color_* / fish_key_bindings universals that
# upstream ships are deliberately absent. They are fish 3.4-era state:
#
#   - colors come from the matugen-generated sequences.txt that config.fish
#     sources, so universal colors are dead weight that fights it;
#   - fish 4.3+ moved fish_key_bindings out of universal scope, so shipping it
#     made fish print the "upgraded to >= 4.3.0" notice on first launch and
#     leave a fish_frozen_key_bindings.fish conf.d file behind.
#
# Without them fish starts on its built-in defaults and stays quiet.
SETUVAR _fisher_jorgebucaran_2F_fisher_files:\x7e/\x2econfig/fish/functions/fisher\x2efish\x1e\x7e/\x2econfig/fish/completions/fisher\x2efish
SETUVAR _fisher_plugins:jorgebucaran/fisher
SETUVAR _fisher_upgraded_to_4_4:\x1d
